# UniQaidar — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# These 200 rewrites prevent the SPA catch-all from intercepting static files.
# NOTE: /sitemap.xml and /sitemap_index.xml are intentionally absent —
# they are handled by functions/[[path]].js which intercepts all requests
# before _redirects applies. A 200 rewrite here would bypass the Function.
/robots.txt         /robots.txt         200
/fonts.json         /fonts.json         200
